        "detailed_description": "<h1>Before You Play &amp; A Note from the Team</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/65ee1bf3e1370f850b30ba78f205349b.avif?t=1779858606\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We made a visual novel that’s a little… different. This time it’s <strong>fully live-action</strong>—real actors, real locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s also an <strong>interactive film-style experience</strong> presented as a visual novel: text + voice + animated stills tell a story that’s both absurd and warm. There are <strong>no complicated inputs</strong> and <strong>no grindy unlock conditions</strong>—we want you to relax and sink into the story. If you’re willing, just sit back and let it play out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you…</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >like “odd-flavored” crossovers of <strong>anime aesthetics + live-action</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >can roll with <strong>gender-swap setups, contrast comedy, and bros facing messy feelings</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are looking for a <strong>chill, bite-sized</strong> visual novel,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or you’re simply curious how far a <strong>live-action VN</strong> can go—</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…then come along with <strong>Eggy</strong>. We know some players may expect a big-budget “interactive movie.” We’re not that. But we <strong>shot every scene with care</strong> and <strong>told a not-so-serious yet pretty fun story</strong>. If what you want is <strong>2–3 hours of light, pleasant company</strong>, you’ll find it here in <strong>“Ballshit”</strong>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/c45c71108827418229fc3e6fab9c1603.avif?t=1779858606\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer <strong>Jia Xu (“Eggy”)</strong> uses a cheat to beat a mysterious player called <strong>“I Am God”</strong> on stream—and gets hit with an eerie “payback.” That night he dreams a twin-tail girl blasts him… in the groin. Worse, he wakes up and realizes he’s <strong>actually turned into a girl</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now <strong>Eggy</strong> has to survive in a <strong>men’s dorm</strong> with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his inseparable best friend <strong>Monkey</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey’s girlfriend <strong>Qin Lian</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the campus queen <strong>Wu Yangyang</strong> (same curse, frosty looks + tough-guy attitude), and</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pangpang</strong>, a chaotic travel companion who used to be a sweet girl and is now a chubby boy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, you’ll face key choices:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Wu Yangyang</strong> to hunt for “I Am God” and seek a way back, or</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the present</strong>, keep living as a girl, and navigate the complicated feelings that may bloom between you and Monkey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These are <strong>two distinct main routes</strong> with <strong>different stories and endings</strong>—your choices decide the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9c73d5614f9dbdbfdf1c424dd8c7cac3.avif?t=1779858606\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jia Xu (“Eggy”)</strong> – A small-time streamer who wakes up as a girl after a cheating incident. Airheaded with a dash of chunibyo; now forced to handle a wild new life in a girl’s body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/fb12df23624bd74d8ac701bee1ae1e09.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey</strong> – <strong>Eggy</strong>’s best friend and roommate. Goofy on the surface, fiercely loyal underneath. Tries to cover for his bro’s “sudden change” and gets pulled into all kinds of ridiculous situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9fe9848401ed272a9b244484aba3eb36.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qin Lian</strong> – Monkey’s girlfriend, an anime-obsessed girl who takes <strong>Eggy</strong> in and becomes his first close female friend. With her help, <strong>Eggy</strong> slowly adapts to a new identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/db75e05d5fe2f3e891242b661730e70c.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wu Yangyang</strong> – The campus beauty with a <strong>Shaanxi-accented, tough-guy soul</strong>. She shares <strong>Eggy</strong>’s predicament, and the contrast fuels endless comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/466bf8905b5ef813990f37912b6c0b97.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pangpang</strong> – A quirky companion met on the road. Once a cute girl, now a chubby boy whose antics make the journey even louder and livelier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/ea2d02f1ebc9c3914f1e196373e5e1cb.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“I Am God”</strong> – A mysterious figure who pops up across games and “punishes” cheaters—the mastermind behind the gender-swaps. Who she really is—and why—waits for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9830f1d7beb182b79475d127ab29f505.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/a09b95b7102127d52bf486ac9236603d.avif?t=1779858606\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully live-action, fully voiced</strong>: Real actors, real performances, real locations. Every beat—joy, anger, grief, and love—lands through on-camera acting for film-like presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hybrid presentation</strong>: We weave three VN styles—<strong>live-action character sprites</strong> for dialogue, <strong>polished CG stills</strong> for key moments, and <strong>short live-action clips</strong> for climaxes—bringing a fresh look and feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two divergent life paths</strong>: Your <strong>binary choices</strong> steer <strong>Eggy</strong> onto very different routes, each with its own storylines and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laugh-out-loud contrast comedy</strong>: Gender misfires spark absurd events and big laughs—while still making room for sincere thoughts on identity and friendship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-save &amp; scene revisit</strong>: Auto-saves let you <strong>revisit completed scenes</strong> to try different options and see alternate endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to join <strong>Eggy</strong> on a bizarre, gender-bending adventure? A live-action visual novel unlike any other is waiting for you!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/c45c71108827418229fc3e6fab9c1603.avif?t=1779858606\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer <strong>Jia Xu (“Eggy”)</strong> uses a cheat to beat a mysterious player called <strong>“I Am God”</strong> on stream—and gets hit with an eerie “payback.” That night he dreams a twin-tail girl blasts him… in the groin. Worse, he wakes up and realizes he’s <strong>actually turned into a girl</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now <strong>Eggy</strong> has to survive in a <strong>men’s dorm</strong> with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his inseparable best friend <strong>Monkey</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey’s girlfriend <strong>Qin Lian</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the campus queen <strong>Wu Yangyang</strong> (same curse, frosty looks + tough-guy attitude), and</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pangpang</strong>, a chaotic travel companion who used to be a sweet girl and is now a chubby boy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, you’ll face key choices:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Wu Yangyang</strong> to hunt for “I Am God” and seek a way back, or</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the present</strong>, keep living as a girl, and navigate the complicated feelings that may bloom between you and Monkey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These are <strong>two distinct main routes</strong> with <strong>different stories and endings</strong>—your choices decide the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset