tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/466bf8905b5ef813990f37912b6c0b97.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pangpang</strong> – A quirky companion met on the road. Once a cute girl, now a chubby boy whose antics make the journey even louder and livelier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/ea2d02f1ebc9c3914f1e196373e5e1cb.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“I Am God”</strong> – A mysterious figure who pops up across games and “punishes” cheaters—the mastermind behind the gender-swaps. Who she really is—and why—waits for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9830f1d7beb182b79475d127ab29f505.avif?t=1779858606\" width=1144 height=866 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/a09b95b7102127d52bf486ac9236603d.avif?t=1779858606\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully live-action, fully voiced</strong>: Real actors, real performances, real locations. Every beat—joy, anger, grief, and love—lands through on-camera acting for film-like presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hybrid presentation</strong>: We weave three VN styles—<strong>live-action character sprites</strong> for dialogue, <strong>polished CG stills</strong> for key moments, and <strong>short live-action clips</strong> for climaxes—bringing a fresh look and feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two divergent life paths</strong>: Your <strong>binary choices</strong> steer <strong>Eggy</strong> onto very different routes, each with its own storylines and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laugh-out-loud contrast comedy</strong>: Gender misfires spark absurd events and big laughs—while still making room for sincere thoughts on identity and friendship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-save &amp; scene revisit</strong>: Auto-saves let you <strong>revisit completed scenes</strong> to try different options and see alternate endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to join <strong>Eggy</strong> on a bizarre, gender-bending adventure? A live-action visual novel unlike any other is waiting for you!</p>",
